/**
 * @file src/data/legal/eu-scc-2021-915.ts
 * @author Jouni Miikki
 * SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT
 * @description The standard contractual clauses between controllers and processors, Commission
 *   Implementing Decision (EU) 2021/915 of 4 June 2021, Annex, in English and Finnish, VERBATIM.
 *   Source: the EU Publications Office (Cellar), CELEX 32021D0915, fetched 2026-10-24 by content
 *   negotiation (Accept-Language eng / fin):
 *     http://publications.europa.eu/resource/celex/32021D0915
 *   Reuse of EU legal texts is permitted under Commission Decision 2011/833/EU. The text is data:
 *   it is never edited by hand. A new official text is fetched again and its hash changes here.
 *
 *   `clauses` is Sections I to III. `annexes` is the four annex templates (I parties, II description
 *   of the processing, III technical and organisational measures, IV sub-processors), whose headings
 *   the generator (services/compliance-agreements-generate.ts) reuses word for word. The choices the
 *   clauses leave open (Clause 1 option, Clause 5, Clause 7.7 option and period) are recorded in the
 *   agreement and printed beside the text, never written into it.
 * @structure SccLanguage · SCC_2021_915 · SCC_2021_915_SHA256
 * @usage const text = SCC_2021_915.fi.clauses;
 * @version-history
 *   v1.0.0 — 2026-10-24 — Initial (plan doc-mvmr4i2wdk0p, D1.2).
 */

